<title>UK: Peptide Therapeutics year loss widens.</title>
<headline>Peptide Therapeutics year loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	 13.5		   vs 20.2 loss</p>
<p> Pretax loss		4.59		   vs 3.61 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   0.15		   vs 0.16</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said operating costs increased to 6.2 million stg in 1996 due to research and development expenditure versus 4.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Peptide Therapeutics Group Plc said it had cash and liquid resources of 20.6 million stg at end-1996 versus 27.0 million stg a year earlier. Cash at February 17 was 27.4 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
